WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.198
- Today we are celebrating
the 20th season of The Voice!

00:00:03.198 --> 00:00:04.622
I'm here with coaches Blake Shelton,

00:00:04.622 --> 00:00:05.852
Nick Jonas and John Legend.

00:00:05.852 --> 00:00:07.382
(Kelly mimics air horn)

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:08.845
(audience cheers)

00:00:08.845 --> 00:00:11.094
So it was recently announced, Nick,

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:12.476
that Ariana is now coming in.

00:00:12.476 --> 00:00:13.646
She's gonna take your seat next season.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.479
So here's the reason why I ask.

00:00:14.479 --> 00:00:15.312
- What?

00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:16.720
- Wait a minute!

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.732
- What?
- Exactly!

00:00:17.732 --> 00:00:19.052
- Wait a minute!
- Exactly!

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.230
It's just this season.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.540
So like, here's my question, though.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.688
Do you have any advice for her?

00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:25.794
- No, I mean, Ariana as we all know

00:00:25.794 --> 00:00:28.157
is one of the best singers in the game,

00:00:28.157 --> 00:00:31.030
and she's gonna be an incredible coach.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.463
I think the only advice I would give,

00:00:33.463 --> 00:00:35.036
is just not to trust any one of you.

00:00:35.036 --> 00:00:36.085
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:36.085 --> 00:00:36.918
- Why?

00:00:36.918 --> 00:00:40.370
- We've been feeding her
lots of useful advice.

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.800
- Yeah, I'm sure. Very useful.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:42.633
- [Kelly] Totally! Yeah.

00:00:42.633 --> 00:00:44.630
But she's gonna kill it. She'll be great.

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:47.458
- Yeah. I thought, yeah, you
can at least warn her about

00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:48.898
the one she's probably gonna sit next to.

00:00:48.898 --> 00:00:49.731
Might be nice.

00:00:49.731 --> 00:00:50.564
- [Nick] All of you.

00:00:50.564 --> 00:00:52.020
- She watches the show, though. She knows.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:52.853
- [Nick] She does.

00:00:52.853 --> 00:00:54.234
- She knows about Blake.

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:55.482
- [Kelly] She does watch the show!

00:00:55.482 --> 00:00:56.972
- What does that mean? What do you mean?

00:00:56.972 --> 00:00:59.356
- Everybody knows about
Blake. Everybody knows.

00:00:59.356 --> 00:01:00.648
- Lies and deception.

00:01:00.648 --> 00:01:02.867
- I just hope I don't step on her.

00:01:02.867 --> 00:01:04.284
Look at her! She looks so tiny on there.

00:01:04.284 --> 00:01:05.284
(Kelly and John laugh)

00:01:05.284 --> 00:01:06.274
- She's so tiny, I know.

00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:07.458
- The height differential
between the two of you

00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:08.499
will be substantial.

00:01:08.499 --> 00:01:09.332
- [Blake] Wow.

00:01:09.332 --> 00:01:10.779
- I really hope she's
sitting right next to you.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.035
It'll just look amazing.

00:01:12.035 --> 00:01:12.976
(Kelly and John laugh)

00:01:12.976 --> 00:01:14.589
So wait. Are y'all scared of Ariana?

00:01:14.589 --> 00:01:16.255
- Uh yes.
- I am too! (John laughs)

00:01:16.255 --> 00:01:17.206
I'm terrified.

00:01:17.206 --> 00:01:19.039
Somebody literally asked us
the interviews yesterday.

00:01:19.039 --> 00:01:19.955
We were going together and they said

00:01:19.955 --> 00:01:20.788
"What do you think about Ariana?"

00:01:20.788 --> 00:01:22.832
I was like, "I think this
is my last chance to win".

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:25.792
(John laughs) I was like,
"That's what I think!"

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:28.162
- Ariana has a huge fan base.
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:01:28.162 --> 00:01:30.030
And they are fervent.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:33.600
And if they show up to
vote, we're all in trouble.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.820
- 100%.
(John laughs)

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.879
Are you scared at all?
- No.

00:01:37.879 --> 00:01:39.428
- [Kelly] Would you even tell us?

00:01:39.428 --> 00:01:40.363
- I'm not afraid of her fan base.

00:01:40.363 --> 00:01:42.214
Where are they at? Look
at me! Where's the camera.

00:01:42.214 --> 00:01:44.666
Bring it, Arianna fans! Bring it on!

00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:46.007
I'm not afraid of all y'all.

00:01:46.007 --> 00:01:47.130
(John laughs)

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:48.410
They pay me to win.

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.764
- Oh my gosh.
- Ya hear that?

00:01:50.764 --> 00:01:53.831
Ariana fans. Is that you guys?

00:01:53.831 --> 00:01:55.006
Are y'all Arianna fans?

00:01:55.006 --> 00:01:55.939
(John laughs)

00:01:55.939 --> 00:01:57.422
See how silent you are?

00:01:57.422 --> 00:01:59.737
(Kelly and John laugh)

00:01:59.737 --> 00:02:01.175
- Okay. Well, speaking of scared,

00:02:01.175 --> 00:02:04.077
I saw you just had an
incident with a possum.

00:02:04.077 --> 00:02:05.623
What happened?

00:02:05.623 --> 00:02:06.789
- What'd you say? I had an incident?

00:02:06.789 --> 00:02:08.314
- [Kelly] You had an
incident with a possum.

00:02:08.314 --> 00:02:09.843
- Incident with a possum. Yeah.

00:02:09.843 --> 00:02:11.689
- They should've sat you next to me!

00:02:11.689 --> 00:02:13.014
So you can hear me!

00:02:13.014 --> 00:02:14.300
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.133
- I did.

00:02:15.133 --> 00:02:18.839
I was at the house in
Oklahoma, and I was just,

00:02:18.839 --> 00:02:21.694
I was there by myself, and
I just grilled something

00:02:21.694 --> 00:02:23.674
on the grill, and I got it out.

00:02:23.674 --> 00:02:25.675
I was letting it cool off
and I went back to get it,

00:02:25.675 --> 00:02:27.910
and it was a damn possum over there.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:31.310
Look! Eating my, I
actually grilled some fish.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:32.840
- [John] Oh my God!

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.176
- [Blake] I was like, "Hey man!"

00:02:35.176 --> 00:02:36.868
- [Kelly] I didn't actually
see this whole thing!

00:02:36.868 --> 00:02:37.710
They told me. Wait!

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:39.172
- [John] I didn't know he ate the food!

00:02:39.172 --> 00:02:40.424
- Yeah! He was in my food.

00:02:40.424 --> 00:02:41.257
- Oh!

00:02:41.257 --> 00:02:44.160
- Later I got, I don't know
if y'all have the video,

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:46.486
I ended up petting it
and hanging out with it.

00:02:46.486 --> 00:02:48.128
- [John] Were you grilling a possum?

00:02:48.128 --> 00:02:50.273
- [Blake] There it is! There
I am petting it. (John laughs)

00:02:50.273 --> 00:02:52.080
I wasn't grilling a possum.
Look at it. He likes me!

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:52.942
- [Kelly] Real quick question.

00:02:52.942 --> 00:02:54.502
Have you ever heard of rabies?

00:02:54.502 --> 00:02:55.335
- [Nick] Yeah.

00:02:55.335 --> 00:02:56.586
- Oh ho ho.

00:02:56.586 --> 00:02:58.940
Well you're probably not
gonna air the next video.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.203
- [Kelly] Well, no, my point.

00:03:00.203 --> 00:03:01.036
- No, I'm just kidding!

00:03:01.036 --> 00:03:03.558
- Oh, what?
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:03:03.558 --> 00:03:06.778
- I had nothing left to
eat, he ate my food so.

00:03:06.778 --> 00:03:08.580
- Oh my gosh!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.979
- No. I let him to it.

00:03:09.979 --> 00:03:13.279
- So John, have you ever
encountered a wild animal?

00:03:13.279 --> 00:03:16.279
- Well, the scariest time we were in

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:18.873
Tanzania.

00:03:18.873 --> 00:03:22.420
- Ooh. I've never done that!
- East Africa.

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.920
And a black mamba.

00:03:24.881 --> 00:03:26.547
- Whoa.
- [John] Which is a snake.

00:03:26.547 --> 00:03:28.257
- Which I know. Which is deadly.

00:03:28.257 --> 00:03:29.261
- And is deadly.

00:03:29.261 --> 00:03:30.761
I did not see this

00:03:31.655 --> 00:03:32.488
black mamba,

00:03:32.488 --> 00:03:35.323
but everyone who was
with me saw it near me,

00:03:35.323 --> 00:03:36.927
and I had, didn't see it.

00:03:36.927 --> 00:03:38.658
I was walking the other way,

00:03:38.658 --> 00:03:41.781
but I was close enough to it
that it could've bitten me,

00:03:41.781 --> 00:03:43.101
but I escaped it.

00:03:43.101 --> 00:03:43.934
And then everyone was like,

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:46.339
"John, did you just see that black mamba?"

00:03:46.339 --> 00:03:48.987
And I completely missed
it, but apparently.

00:03:48.987 --> 00:03:49.916
- That's probably why you
didn't get bit, though.

00:03:49.916 --> 00:03:50.867
'Cause you didn't freak out.

00:03:50.867 --> 00:03:52.085
- Yeah. Well I didn't notice it.

00:03:52.085 --> 00:03:53.862
- That's what I'm
saying. You were so calm.

00:03:53.862 --> 00:03:54.970
- And so it was right there, though.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:55.917
It could have gotten me.

00:03:55.917 --> 00:03:56.750
- [Kelly] Dang!

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:57.583
- Yeah.

00:03:57.583 --> 00:03:58.416
- That is wild.

00:03:58.416 --> 00:03:59.369
- Cause I've Been on one of the safaris.

00:03:59.369 --> 00:04:00.343
I think they just carry a gun in case.

00:04:00.343 --> 00:04:02.091
They don't carry like, you know,
something to save your life

00:04:02.091 --> 00:04:04.203
if you get bit by snake. (John laughs)

00:04:04.203 --> 00:04:05.485
Like, wow! That's scary!

00:04:05.485 --> 00:04:06.318
- Yes!

00:04:06.318 --> 00:04:07.151
- Yeah.

00:04:07.151 --> 00:04:08.379
- So, I didn't know to be scared or not,

00:04:08.379 --> 00:04:09.543
'cause I didn't actually see it,

00:04:09.543 --> 00:04:11.665
but everyone around me
was very scared for me.

00:04:11.665 --> 00:04:13.099
- Oh my God. I'd've freaked out.

00:04:13.099 --> 00:04:15.401
Have you? Have you ever had
anything crazy, like animal?

00:04:15.401 --> 00:04:17.875
- I have, yeah. Not as scary as that.

00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:19.425
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:22.503
- But I got chased by
a pack of coyotes once.

00:04:22.503 --> 00:04:23.336
- [All] What?!

00:04:23.336 --> 00:04:24.169
- Come on.

00:04:24.169 --> 00:04:25.002
- I swear to God!

00:04:25.002 --> 00:04:25.835
- A pack?

00:04:25.835 --> 00:04:28.153
- You Jonas boys. Every of
you tell crap like that.

00:04:28.153 --> 00:04:29.715
(all laugh)

00:04:29.715 --> 00:04:32.151
- Wait, what do you mean?
Like a pack of coyotes?

00:04:32.151 --> 00:04:32.984
That's dangerous!

00:04:32.984 --> 00:04:37.517
- Yeah so, I was just coming
out of a movie theater.

00:04:37.517 --> 00:04:39.571
- This is in Los Angeles?
- This is in Los Angeles.

00:04:39.571 --> 00:04:40.493
And

00:04:40.493 --> 00:04:43.787
I step outside and start
walking by myself, walking home.

00:04:43.787 --> 00:04:44.962
My friend's like, "We'll give you a ride."

00:04:44.962 --> 00:04:47.028
I was like, "I wanna get some fresh air."

00:04:47.028 --> 00:04:47.861
And so, I'm walking.

00:04:47.861 --> 00:04:50.277
And then I see these eyes in the dark.

00:04:50.277 --> 00:04:53.860
And then I see about
six more sets of eyes.

00:04:54.877 --> 00:04:56.091
- They just wanted an autograph.

00:04:56.091 --> 00:04:57.853
- They take off running after me.

00:04:57.853 --> 00:04:58.686
- [Kelly] That's terrifying.

00:04:58.686 --> 00:05:02.421
- So I go full sprint, like
this, about half a mile

00:05:02.421 --> 00:05:05.473
to my house, jumped the fence,
and they're all at the fence.

00:05:05.473 --> 00:05:07.121
And they don't chase people normally.

00:05:07.121 --> 00:05:08.997
They do in a pack, though. They will.

00:05:08.997 --> 00:05:09.830
- Oh my God.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.113
- So it was quite frightening.

00:05:11.113 --> 00:05:13.161
I should mention that when
I was getting the fresh air,

00:05:13.161 --> 00:05:16.556
I may have (Nick puffs air)
you know, a little bit.

00:05:16.556 --> 00:05:18.763
- Giving the aroma to be attracted too.

00:05:18.763 --> 00:05:19.596
- Got it. Got it.

00:05:19.596 --> 00:05:21.729
- Okay. Okay. So wait. So wait.

00:05:21.729 --> 00:05:23.421
- So this may or may not have happened.

00:05:23.421 --> 00:05:25.446
- So really what chased you
are a bunch of maltipoos?

00:05:25.446 --> 00:05:27.058
(Kelly laughs)

00:05:27.058 --> 00:05:29.886
- Are you saying Coyotes are
attracted to the smell of?

00:05:29.886 --> 00:05:31.842
- You had like a bunch of
Beverly Hills Chihuahuas

00:05:31.842 --> 00:05:34.852
chasing you like it's a
wild, rabid, pack of dogs.

00:05:34.852 --> 00:05:36.473
- Yeah, so. No one else was with me.

00:05:36.473 --> 00:05:38.369
I can't be sure that is what happened.

00:05:38.369 --> 00:05:41.777
- Oh my God.
(Kelly laughs)

00:05:41.777 --> 00:05:42.610
- [Kelly] My God!

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.067
- You lost me at fresh air
in Los Angeles, anyway.

00:05:45.067 --> 00:05:45.923
(John laughs)

00:05:45.923 --> 00:05:48.083
- Lies and deception. Agreed.

00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:49.762
So before we go to break,
I want to talk about

00:05:49.762 --> 00:05:52.111
something that happened
earlier this season.

00:05:52.111 --> 00:05:55.029
The date was October 19th, 2020.

00:05:55.029 --> 00:05:57.848
I graciously invited
Blake to be on my show

00:05:57.848 --> 00:05:59.423
to promote his vodka.

00:05:59.423 --> 00:06:03.421
Not only did he forget his Team
Kelly jacket, this happened.

00:06:03.421 --> 00:06:06.031
- Because I've noticed over
the years that you play

00:06:06.031 --> 00:06:06.864
a lot of games.

00:06:06.864 --> 00:06:08.530
- [Kelly] Yes.
- Even outside of this show.

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:09.363
- [Kelly] I do.

00:06:09.363 --> 00:06:10.607
- Like you're a gamer.

00:06:10.607 --> 00:06:13.325
- I'm a winner as well.

00:06:13.325 --> 00:06:15.357
- A winner? Exactly right.

00:06:15.357 --> 00:06:16.190
Which maybe,

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.649
maybe this gift, well,

00:06:18.649 --> 00:06:21.263
goes against that idea that
you're a winner all the time.

00:06:21.263 --> 00:06:22.501
- Oh. So it's a lie.

00:06:22.501 --> 00:06:24.685
- This is a gift that represents,

00:06:24.685 --> 00:06:25.518
- [Kelly] Lies.

00:06:25.518 --> 00:06:28.986
- Every person who has
beaten you on your show

00:06:28.986 --> 00:06:31.342
with the podium that I gave you.

00:06:31.342 --> 00:06:32.652
(guitar plays)

00:06:32.652 --> 00:06:36.569
- Wait a minute! All
these people have beat me?

00:06:37.741 --> 00:06:39.861
- I've never missed an
episode of your show.

00:06:39.861 --> 00:06:41.338
(Kelly laughs)

00:06:41.338 --> 00:06:46.338
And I wrote down every single
time somebody has beaten you.

00:06:46.364 --> 00:06:48.687
(audience cheers)

00:06:48.687 --> 00:06:50.030
- I hate that wall!

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:53.496
There are now, whatever,
17 photos up there,

00:06:53.496 --> 00:06:54.404
including Blake's.

